{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-20T10:34:24.727Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"1e3aaed2ebb33413fa918dd9","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-02z97f"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1518: recover provably dead same-host item-lock owners before TTL expiry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1518 reports on published 2026.10.20/Linux/plain non-Git trackers that a killed public-SDK lock holder leaves an item unavailable for the full 3600-second TTL. Later update/comments calls and force recovery refuse after the normal wait, while health counts the receipt as active. This is reporter evidence; current-head reproduction and implementation remain pending. The new boundary is provable same-host process death before TTL expiry, rather than expired-lock GC, live-lock throughput or safe ownership publication."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:locking","concurrency"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-20T10:34:24.727Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-20T10:34:24.727Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Add owned-sandbox SDK and CLI crash recovery tests. Record enough host/process-start identity to distinguish a dead original owner from PID reuse, foreign hosts, EPERM/unknown liveness and legacy receipts. Reclaim only with positive proof through the existing token-validated stale-cleanup gate, preserving initialization and single-winner takeover invariants. Keep unknown/live owners and malformed/partial receipts conservative. Health, GC and conflict recovery should consistently expose liveness/staleness and an actionable actual command; record recovery provenance without losing acknowledged writes."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-dj98"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A provably dead same-host owner cannot block writes for an hour, while live, reused, foreign-host or unknown process identities remain protected."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-d70h","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-10-20T10:34:24.727Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-lvyd","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-10-20T10:34:24.727Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-v2pg4f","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-10-20T10:34:24.727Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-zwib","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-10-20T10:34:24.727Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-20T10:34:24.727Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check: fresh request-specific searches, open/in-progress inventories and complete strict 3023-item all-status read found no matching open item. Full live records/comments/history for the concurrency parent and the TTL cleanup and takeover/publication precursors distinguish the requested liveness boundary. Their existing completed scopes are preserved. The live-lock report remains in pm-lvyd; this issue remains open and unclaimed."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"fc4060e4ee73c601f633cb621857e547e82bb4431ea48f1153db13c90498a880","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"2e4329c0051044faa06f9ea112679d02b0a776bb5efc98409c25a948c2aefdec"}
